  "answer_text": "There are several entities with the name \"Chase Capital Services\" or similar names. Here is an overview of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfe6 JPMorgan Chase \u2013 Capital & Commercial Services\nChase offers a broad range of financial services including credit cards, mortgages, commercial banking, auto loans, investing, and retirement planning. On the commercial side, JPMorgan Chase provides tailored credit, financing, treasury, and payment solutions for businesses of all sizes and commercial real estate, with dedicated experts delivering industry-specific guidance to help clients manage cash flow and achieve strategic goals.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83c\udfe0 Chase Capital Holdings, LLC (Atlanta, GA)\nChase Capital Holdings, LLC is a trusted partner in investment real estate financing and a family-owned and operated boutique lending business based in Atlanta, with over 20 years of expertise in the industry. Their mission is to cater to the needs of experienced real estate investors throughout the Southeastern United States, offering quick and straightforward funding solutions for residential real estate investments.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83c\udf3f Chase Capital (Canada)\nChase Capital is a private capital platform dedicated to investing in, advising, and helping unique businesses grow into dynamic platforms across Canada and other regions globally, bringing valuable capital and trusted industry expertise to acquisitions and partnerships with existing owners and operators. They drive success in key growth sectors such as energy transition, waste & resource recovery infrastructure, and food & agricultural production, with a focus on sustainable and innovative projects. Unlike traditional private equity funds, they invest their own capital and collaborate with a network of experienced entrepreneurs and investors not bound by fixed exit timelines or rigid investment criteria.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83d\udcc8 Chase Capital Partners (Crunchbase)\nChase Capital Partners is permanently closed. It was previously known for its broad financial platform, delivering extensive product capabilities including lending, treasury services, investment banking, and asset management to meet clients' U.S. and international financial needs.\n\n---\n\nCould you clarify which **Chase Capital Services** you are referring to? For example:\n- Are you looking for **JPMorgan Chase's** capital services?\n- The **real estate lending** firm in Atlanta?\n- The **Canadian private capital** platform?\n- Something else entirely?\n\nThis will help me provide you with more specific and accurate information! \ud83d\ude0a",
